# API Configuration

# Development (using Vite proxy to avoid CORS)
# Requests to /api are proxied to http://localhost:8080/api
VITE_API_BASE_URL=/api

# Production (direct API connection)
# VITE_API_BASE_URL=http://localhost:8080/api
# VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://your-production-api.com/api

# Instructions:
# 1. Copy this file to .env
# 2. For development, use VITE_API_BASE_URL=/api (leverages Vite proxy)
# 3. For production build, use absolute URL
# 4. Never commit .env file to version control

# Note: Vite dev server proxy eliminates CORS preflight issues during development
# The proxy is configured in vite.config.ts
